<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.52.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.52.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.52.0 (2026-11-25): Correction before closure. The lineage status had stayed at Opened although its stages and all work were done (the same lapse as in the paused lineage, corrected there in its 1.26.0); it is moved to In Progress so that closure follows the status order."""@en .

ex:Lineage11 backlog:hasLineageStatus backlog:LS_InProgress ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Status corrected on 2026-11-25: 19 stories and 39 tasks are Done, so the status Opened understated the lineage." .
